starting it\ndrops queued actions. Clients retry, but do it when a retry storm is cheap."]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Run a real build"}],", then run it again. The first proves the new version works;\nthe second proves it can still read what the old version wrote, which is the\nquestion that actually matters."]}]}]]}]
1d:["$","div",null,{"data-verify-block":"","className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-success/40 bg-success-soft/50 px-5 py-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2.25","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"shrink-0 text-success","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}]}],"You did it right if"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"[&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2 [&>ul]:my-0","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Every process is running the intended tag, and you can prove it rather than\nassume it."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"A build run before the upgrade gets cache hits after it. This is the\ndata-compatibility check."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Remote execution actions complete on upgraded workers."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Nothing in any process log mentions an unknown or deprecated config field."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"The previous image tag plus the previous config file are still somewhere you\ncan reach in under a minute."}],"\n"]}]}]]}]
